"61105","senseId":"4","lemma":"따라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라가기","audio":"/audio/46d76f6c72a162d89e1c.mp3"}},{"text":"마련이야.","meaning":"难免，必然","explanation":"마련：难免，必然；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"마련","audio":"/audio/e0cb6646df7a19346e75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14616","senseId":"1","lemma":"마련","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마련이야","audio":"/audio/ee5b61c71b6944dcbfb6.mp3"}},{"text":"너부터","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너부터","audio":"/audio/3109c128fb19e1deb986.mp3"}},{"text":"변해야","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변해야","audio":"/audio/36e298f3f7e8f2b12a6b.mp3"}},{"text":"자식도","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자식：子女；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"자식","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49308","senseId":"1","lemma":"자식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자식도","audio":"/audio/32bf3210009abf0e36a8.mp3"}},{"text":"변해.","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변해","audio":"/audio/2dcd98e1a76e6345b1f0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b642f4b4b990f838","term":"자식","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3","entryId":"49308","definition":"儿子和女儿，或单指儿子或女儿。","pronunciation":["자식"]},{"id":"881a8172c7dcec2e","term